==Description==
'''Krampus''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was obtained from Level 38 of the premium track, which costs {{Bell|1,360}} or {{Robux|106}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|24,220}} or {{Robux|4,402}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases [[Krampus (Krampus Frosthold)|Krampus]], with large outlined "''BRUH''" text appearing underneath it written in Impact font. When used, it will play a sound effect of [[Krampus (Krampus Frosthold)|Krampus]] saying "''bruh''" harshly, followed by a [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/vine-thud-boom-sound-effect Vine boom] sound effect.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is a reference to the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/bruh bruh] meme.
**The sound effect that plays alongside the word is the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/vine-thud-boom-sound-effect Vine boom] sound effect.

